flowchart TB
  %% Compact vertical layout
  U["User"] -->|POST /auth/login| Auth["Auth Ctrl"]
  Auth -->|validate| Users[(Users)]
  Auth -->|create session| Sessions[(Sessions)]
  Auth -->|issue tokens| Tokens[(Tokens)]
  Tokens -->|store refresh| Client["Client App"]

  Client -->|call| Protected["Protected API"]
  Protected -->|refresh| Refresh["/auth/refresh"]
  Refresh -->|verify| Sessions
  Refresh -->|rotate| Sessions
  Refresh -->|return| Client

  Logout["Logout"] -->|revoke| Sessions
  Sessions -->|revoke| Users

  subgraph DriveOAuth[Google Drive OAuth]
    Auth -->|Google OAuth| OAuth["OAuth Flow"]
    OAuth -->|store| UserToken[(UserToken)]
    UserToken -->|used by| Drive[(Drive API)]
  end
